### ⚠️ Mandatory Rule for All New Edge Functions

Every new edge function **must** have a `[functions.<name>]` config block in `supabase/config.toml` with `verify_jwt = false`. This project uses custom `APP_JWT_SECRET` tokens verified internally via `_shared/jwt-utils.ts` — without this block, Supabase's gateway rejects requests with 401 before the function code runs.

**Checklist when adding any new function:**
- [ ] Create function under `supabase/functions/<name>/`
- [ ] Add `[functions.<name>]` / `verify_jwt = false` to `supabase/config.toml`
- [ ] Deploy: `supabase functions deploy <name>`
- [ ] Verify: `supabase functions list` shows `ACTIVE`

